This patch is part of SaveHITL-pub. The SaveHITL project changed the
following OpenL2D file in 2026:
  Code/alert_data/dataset_cfg.yaml
Why: it fixes a defect in OpenL2D. The protected-attribute entry names
the feature "age" with type "numeric". The generator's code tests for
"numerical" or "categorical", and the dataset's column is
"customer_age". So the attribute is silently not split at age 50,
contrary to the code's own comment. This patch names "customer_age"
with type "numerical".
